      "text": "Heavy rainfall caused flooding in several parts of Quezon City on Saturday afternoon, June 21.\n \nHere is the situation in some areas as of 7:00 p.m., according to the local government unit. #FloodPatrol \n\nCHEST-DEEP\nBarangay Sto. Domingo\n• Don Manuel corner Biak na Bato,\n• Retiro corner Biak na Bato\n• Calamba corner Biak na Bato\n• Calamba corner Don Pepe\n\nWAIST DEEP\n• Kintanlad corner Araneta, Brgy. Tatalon\n• Victory corner Araneta, Brgy. Tatalon\n• Biak na Bato corner Samat\n• Biak na Bato corner Macopa\n• NS Amoranto corner Don Jose\n\nKNEE-DEEP\n• Manunggal corner Kabignayan, Brgy. Tatalon\nBarangay Sto. Domingo\n• Brgy. Sto. Domingo Hall\n• Don Pepe St. corner Tirad Pass\n• Sto. Domingo corner Calamba\n• Banawe corner Retiro\n• Banawe corner P. Florentino\n• Maria Clara corner Araneta\n• Maria Clara corner Don Pepe\n• Maria Clara corner AIB\nBarangay Masambong\n• Masambong Elementary Malasimbo St.\n• Inaman St.\n• Amusian St.\n\nGUTTER-DEEP\n• Calamba St., Brgy. San Isidro Labrador\n\nANKLE-DEEP\n•Palali Tabayoc St. along NS Amoranto",
